module

public import Motivic.Cohomology.AffineLine.RankZero

/-!
# Ordinary Nisnevich cohomology of the affine line

For arbitrary ordinary abelian coefficients on the original smooth Nisnevich
site over a field, degrees at least two vanish. For homotopy-invariant
Nisnevich sheaves with transfers, every positive degree vanishes. The original
cohomology groups, coefficient universes and ordinary HasExt bookkeeping are
retained. This optional entry does not assert strict A1 invariance on all
smooth schemes.
-/
